## 5. Danh sách commit
1. `7a056aa` - `fix(auth): enforce default-deny in preHandler and block traversal URL paths`
2. `ffd2d4f` - `fix(server): resolve web dist directory relative to module and support AGENTHUB_WEB_DIR`
3. `fa9fa59` - `fix(server): return 404 json for nonexistent /api routes and restrict SPA fallback`
4. `9230c62` - `fix(cli): use execFile instead of exec for xdg-open`
